### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare the response body with the configured contains validation. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
A changed API response, an authentication page or a dependency error.

### Fix
Correct the endpoint/authentication or update the validation to the intended API contract.

### Verify
The next validation passes and the failed-response observation is superseded. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
